* Both r68s shift right a 32-bit signed value, arithmetically: $80000000>>4 is $f8000000 (C 3.2's
* R68 and Ultra C's r68 alike); gas's >> is logical on 64 bits.
* fixed: 4ea5c19 2026-10-11 r68togas: >> arithmetic on 32 bits, as both r68s shift
* expect text: f8000000 fffffffc 04000000 fffffff8 ffff4e71
 psect shift_right,0,0,0,0,0
 dc.l $80000000>>4
 dc.l -16>>2
 dc.l $40000000>>4
 dc.l ($80000000>>4)>>24
 dc.w -1>>16
 ends
